    "detailed_description": "In the Grand Archipelago, is the island of Melas. During the great War of Land and Sky, when the humans turned against the arrogant Sky People, this island served as the beating heart of the world... But when times of peace came, Melas nearly became ground zero for the end of days when the cruel Shaper of Magic, Warlock, was set loose. Twenty years have passed since the people of Melas rose up to defeat Warlock, and now his heinous worshippers seek to resurrect him from his ashes. It is up to you to do everything in your power to stop the dark Wicken Cult, and prevent the second coming of Warlock.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLong Steel is an action-adventure RPG that aims to challenge the player. Battle monsters to gain xp, and level up to become strong enough to face greater challenges. As you embark on your quest, you will find many items to unlock new paths and come face to face with puzzles, obstacles and treacherous dungeon bosses. Slice, shoot and cast magic spells to pave your way through the punishing landscapes. Cooking food, alchemizing potions and crafting new weapons will aid you on your journey. Complete side quests and explore the world to find items that will make you strong enough to cut down any foe that dares to cross your path!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- Key Features ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Travel through diverse landscapes<br />\r\n\u2022 Fight your way through 9 dungeons<br />\r\n\u2022 Meet over a hundred NPCS<br />\r\n\u2022 Cook, Smith, and Alchemize equipment, weapons, potions and food<br />\r\n\u2022 Complete lots of side quests<br />\r\n\u2022 Traverse through mini dungeons<br />\r\n\u2022 Level to 30, increasing your health, mana and stamina as you go<br />\r\n\u2022 Find upgrades to make you stronger and more durable<br />\r\n\u2022 Lots of hidden secrets and easter eggs!<br />\r\n\u2022 And lots more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- Controls ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeyboard                                           Controller<br />\r\n\u2022Pause: D Key                                    \u2022Pause: Left Bumper <br />\r\n\u2022Attack/Save: C Key                          \u2022Attack/Save: Right Button         <br />\r\n\u2022Action: Space bar                            \u2022Action: Bottom Button  <br />\r\n\u2022Item keys: X and V Keys                  \u2022Item keys: Left and Top Buttons                           <br />\r\n\u2022Movement: Arrow Keys                   \u2022Movement: Left Joystick           <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLong Steel is created with the Solarus Game Engine, a free, open-source game engine.",
    "about_the_game": "In the Grand Archipelago, is the island of Melas. During the great War of Land and Sky, when the humans turned against the arrogant Sky People, this island served as the beating heart of the world... But when times of peace came, Melas nearly became ground zero for the end of days when the cruel Shaper of Magic, Warlock, was set loose. Twenty years have passed since the people of Melas rose up to defeat Warlock, and now his heinous worshippers seek to resurrect him from his ashes. It is up to you to do everything in your power to stop the dark Wicken Cult, and prevent the second coming of Warlock.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLong Steel is an action-adventure RPG that aims to challenge the player. Battle monsters to gain xp, and level up to become strong enough to face greater challenges. As you embark on your quest, you will find many items to unlock new paths and come face to face with puzzles, obstacles and treacherous dungeon bosses. Slice, shoot and cast magic spells to pave your way through the punishing landscapes. Cooking food, alchemizing potions and crafting new weapons will aid you on your journey. Complete side quests and explore the world to find items that will make you strong enough to cut down any foe that dares to cross your path!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- Key Features ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u2022 Travel through diverse landscapes<br />\r\n\u2022 Fight your way through 9 dungeons<br />\r\n\u2022 Meet over a hundred NPCS<br />\r\n\u2022 Cook, Smith, and Alchemize equipment, weapons, potions and food<br />\r\n\u2022 Complete lots of side quests<br />\r\n\u2022 Traverse through mini dungeons<br />\r\n\u2022 Level to 30, increasing your health, mana and stamina as you go<br />\r\n\u2022 Find upgrades to make you stronger and more durable<br />\r\n\u2022 Lots of hidden secrets and easter eggs!<br />\r\n\u2022 And lots more!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n--- Controls ---<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKeyboard                                           Controller<br />\r\n\u2022Pause: D Key                                    \u2022Pause: Left Bumper <br />\r\n\u2022Attack/Save: C Key                          \u2022Attack/Save: Right Button         <br />\r\n\u2022Action: Space bar                            \u2022Action: Bottom Button  <br />\r\n\u2022Item keys: X and V Keys                  \u2022Item keys: Left and Top Buttons                           <br />\r\n\u2022Movement: Arrow Keys                   \u2022Movement: Left Joystick           <br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nLong Steel is created with the Solarus Game Engine, a free, open-source game engine.",
